{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/39N6JK-7rcaRBCXmhX6bvQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:49.610389+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/39N6JK-7rcaRBCXmhX6bvQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/pZKSg9ELorML1CVowSMRibiarb7MG0y1LePkOAeRIichKW6HNOfvn1OodUibHTnoCyUFH7TzG7tTZn1ugic92SAqoEw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>华东理工大学体育科学与工程学院</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2025年全国优秀大学生</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>暑期</span></strong><strong><span>学术夏令营活动通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/pZKSg9ELorML1CVowSMRibiarb7MG0y1LePkOAeRIichKW6HNOfvn1OodUibHTnoCyUFH7TzG7tTZn1ugic92SAqoEw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>前言</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>华东理工大学体育科学与工程学院自1988年开始招收高水平大学生运动员，2003年获批体育人文社会学硕士学位授权点，2023年开设运动训练本科专业，2024年获批体育硕士专业学位授权点。学院设有华东理工大学-成信健康科学与工程研究院，以及体育经济理论研究所和体育材料研究所，拥有乒乓球、网球、篮球等5支高水平运动队，乒乓球俱乐部常年参加中国乒乓球俱乐部超级联赛。学院与上海久事体育集团、山东泰山体育产业集团、安徽东黄山运动中心、每步科技（上海）等联合设立产教融合实践基地。</span></p><p><span>体育科学与工程学院2025年“全国优秀大学生暑期学术夏令营”活动拟定于</span><span><strong><span>7月9日</span></strong></span><span>线下举行，热忱欢迎来自全国各地的优秀大三本科生参加。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>招生对象</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/pZKSg9ELorML1CVowSMRibiarb7MG0y1LeYbfwmKTqwXo5j7n6aLXetiaUboVgic8TIC4iaHBg9IhZ4edZOmdIibLhzQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>面向全国高等院校本科2022级（拟2026年夏毕业）的优秀在校大学生。本科专业不限于体育学科，社会、人文、理工科各专业学生均可申请。</span></p><p><span>本次招收营员不超过30人。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/pZKSg9ELorML1CVowSMRibiarb7MG0y1LeYbfwmKTqwXo5j7n6aLXetiaUboVgic8TIC4iaHBg9IhZ4edZOmdIibLhzQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><ol><li><p><span>政治思想品德合格、身体健康；</span></p></li><li><p><span>学习成绩优异，英语水平良好，必修课成绩均为及格以上，原则上将获得所在本科学校免试推荐研究生资格；</span></p></li><li><p><span>对体育领域的科学研究有浓厚的兴趣，具有较强的学术创新或实践应用能力。</span></p></li></ol></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>举办时间和内容形式</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/pZKSg9ELorML1CVowSMRibiarb7MG0y1LeYbfwmKTqwXo5j7n6aLXetiaUboVgic8TIC4iaHBg9IhZ4edZOmdIibLhzQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><ol><li><p><span>举办时间：</span><span><strong><span>2025年7月9日</span></strong></span></p></li><li><p><span>举办形式：线下</span></p></li><li><p><span>活动内容：开闭幕式、学术讲座、校园参观、小组研讨</span></p></li><li><p><span>本次夏令营活动不收取任何费用，活动当天提供中、晚两餐，营员的交通和住宿费自理。夏令营营员如最终被我院录取，将在新生注册报到后给予适当补助（上海地区学校学生补助500元/人，外地学校学生补助2000元/人）。我院将为入选营员统一购买在华东理工大学活动期间的团体意外保险。</span></p></li></ol></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/pZKSg9ELorML1CVowSMRibiarb7MG0y1LeYbfwmKTqwXo5j7n6aLXetiaUboVgic8TIC4iaHBg9IhZ4edZOmdIibLhzQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>申请者即日起至7月2日13：00登录华东理工大学夏令营报名系统，申请网址：http://yz.ecust.edu.cn，填写相关信息。</span></p><p><span>营员名单于7月3日前后在我院网站（https://tyx.ecust.edu.cn/）公布。同时也将通过邮件告知夏令营营员QQ群号</span><strong><span>（请在报名系统中准确填写邮箱）</span></strong><span>。请同学们密切关注邮箱。未接到入营通知的同学不再另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/pZKSg9ELorML1CVowSMRibiarb7MG0y1LeYbfwmKTqwXo5j7n6aLXetiaUboVgic8TIC4iaHBg9IhZ4edZOmdIibLhzQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>申请及材料上传</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/pZKSg9ELorML1CVowSMRibiarb7MG0y1LeqhQ51uLp864E88F3Z6ezjmQNvKSXswKveQT4UvbkPgzDLI0pYvgkyg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>申请夏令营的学生需通过夏令营报名系统上传申请材料，不需要邮寄纸质材料。具体如下：</span></p><ol><li><p><span>身份证正反面扫描件/照片</span></p></li><li><p><span>教育部学籍在线验证报告：登录“高等教育学生信息咨询网”（www.chsi.com.cn），进入“学信档案”在线申请学籍验证；</span></p></li><li><p><span>学校盖章的申请表扫描件1份，申请表在报名系统内生成；</span></p></li><li><p><span>学校教务处盖章的成绩单扫描件1份</span></p></li><li><p><span>个人陈述（介绍本人的外语能力、学习业绩、获奖情况、论文发表情况、专业能力倾向、研究成果、学术研究兴趣、曾参与过的科研项目、创新意识创新能力、研究生阶段的学习和研究计划、其它特长及本人认为对于申请有参考价值的内容）</span></p></li><li><p><span>英语等级证书成绩复印件1份（包括国家英语四、六级、托福、雅思成绩证明）</span></p></li></ol></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>入营阶段</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/pZKSg9ELorML1CVowSMRibiarb7MG0y1LeqhQ51uLp864E88F3Z6ezjmQNvKSXswKveQT4UvbkPgzDLI0pYvgkyg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>在确定被录取为营员后，需在入营报到时携带如上述①-⑥全部材料，除身份证、学生证及外语水平证明收复印件外，其他材料需提供原件。</span></p><p><span>申请者必须保证所提交申请材料的真实性和准确性，若在任何阶段发现申请材料的不真实、不准确，或有弄虚作假、违纪作弊等行为的，立即取消申请人的一切资格，一切后果自行承担。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>联系咨询</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/pZKSg9ELorML1CVowSMRibiarb7MG0y1LeYbfwmKTqwXo5j7n6aLXetiaUboVgic8TIC4iaHBg9IhZ4edZOmdIibLhzQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>体育学院：吴老师 电话：64252264</span></p><p><span>E-mail：clairewty@mail.ecust.edu.cn</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/pZKSg9ELorML1CVowSMRibiarb7MG0y1LenKVgib7d8FxqFekuC5wiayTGk0stSWmgNFdH3FlopqPZOtGxYFblc7mg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>华理体育，与您同在</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"452186c84349346b63dc1d98e2860693732d58245dfd5fce6fd304b3b9400444","textLength":1427,"sourceSha256":"16e01b3e3ab0f745a072bc42608971842cccb2fb1066a4daebe626bda7c9af2f","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-3b7fdeda03f038e21cb7","title":"2025年华东理工大学体育科学与工程学院2025年全国优秀大学生暑期学术夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:49.610389+00:00"}
